Package: UbiPanTriage
Type: Package
Title: Pan-Cancer Ubiquitin Immunometabolic Scoring for Gene Sets (泛癌泛素免疫代谢四维评分)
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Lianxi", "R", email = "wangyy_666@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes a four-dimensional (Ubiquitin / Basic / Immune / Metabolic) scoring
    system for user-defined gene sets in TCGA cancers. The Basic dimension
    combines expression, differential expression, univariate Cox survival and
    ROC evidence; the Immune and Metabolic dimensions are based on weighted
    Spearman correlations with immune infiltration (TIMER / CIBERSORT /
    MCPcounter / ssGSEA / xCell) and GSVA metabolic pathway scores. All
    sub-item weights are user-adjustable. Includes an interactive Shiny
    interface for gene-set pan-cancer ranking, single-gene query (radar /
    correlation / boxplot / ROC / KM / automatic bilingual inference) and
    custom gene-set upload. 面向泛癌转录组，对用户基因集进行基础/免疫/代谢
    三维评分、排序与可视化，并提供交互式网页界面。
